unctional Medical Battalion applies a flu vaccination shot to Soldier from Camp Carroll as a part of the Flu Drive at Camp Carroll, Republic of Korea, October 26th, 2026. Getting vaccinated is essential in personal, unit, and medical readiness as it prevents Soldiers from being unable to accomplish their mission due to health issues, allowing them to be ready to fight tonight. (U.S. Army photo by Cpl Donghyun Ko and Pfc Jongyoon Rah)","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"U.S. Army photo by Pfc. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.dvidshub.net/portfolio/1946337\">Donghyun Ko</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]}}}}